{"id":"328ad4f74d95a74b","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-axiom.md","title":"真理公理","display":"df-truth-axiom — 真理公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-axiom","aliases":["91-df-truth-axiom"],"display":"df-truth-axiom — 真理公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-axiom — 真理公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-axiom-—-真理公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_T$\">df-truth-axiom — 真理公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span> (基础语言 T-schema 实例集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{T}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{T}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_T\\)</span> : 真理公理集（T-schema的所有实例）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_0\\)</span> : 基础语言句子集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\)</span> : &quot;x是句子&quot;谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：真理公理是T-schema对基础语言句子的逐实例化。这里定义的是一个公理模式的实例集合，而不是在基础语言内部假定一个未定义的模型论真谓词。</p>\n<p>该记号直接复用 T-schema 节点的规范实例集，避免为同一公理模式给出\n第二套不一致的编码。TB 直接采用它；UTB 采用带参数的统一版本；KF\n则以组合公理为核心并在基础语言上导出相应双条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-axiom-—-真理公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_T$","text":"df-truth-axiom — 真理公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-